            "content": "# DeepSeek Agent - Final QA, Bug Fixing, and Production Validation\n\nThe application has been migrated from localStorage\/ICP to PHP + MySQL on cPanel.\n\nDo NOT redesign the application.\n\nDo NOT change the UI.\n\nOnly verify, test, and fix bugs.\n\n## Phase 1 - End-to-End Testing\n\nAutomatically test every feature.\n\n### Authentication\n\n* Login\n* Logout\n* Session timeout\n* Invalid login\n* Password hashing\n* Session persistence\n* Role permissions\n\n---\n\n### Patient Module\n\nTest:\n\n* Create patient\n* Edit patient\n* Delete patient\n* Search patient\n* Pagination\n* Filters\n* Patient profile\n* Photo upload\n\nVerify data is saved in MySQL.\n\nRefresh after every action.\n\n---\n\n### Appointment Module\n\nTest:\n\n* Create\n* Edit\n* Cancel\n* Reschedule\n* View history\n\nVerify persistence.\n\n---\n\n### Clinical Module\n\nTest:\n\n* SOAP Notes\n* Vitals\n* Prescriptions\n* Investigations\n* Advice\n* Referrals\n\nVerify every record is stored correctly.\n\n---\n\n### Billing Module\n\nTest:\n\n* Payments\n* Invoices\n* Receipts\n\nVerify calculations and persistence.\n\n---\n\n### Notifications\n\nTest:\n\n* Create\n* Read\n* Delete\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2 - API Testing\n\nAutomatically test every PHP endpoint.\n\nFor each endpoint verify:\n\n* Success response\n* Invalid input\n* Missing fields\n* SQL injection attempt\n* Authentication\n* Authorization\n* HTTP status code\n* JSON response format\n\nGenerate a report.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3 - Database Validation\n\nVerify:\n\n* Foreign keys\n* Indexes\n* AUTO_INCREMENT\n* Duplicate prevention\n* Transactions\n* Rollbacks\n* Constraints\n\nFind orphaned data.\n\nOptimize slow queries.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4 - Frontend Validation\n\nCheck every React page.\n\nEnsure:\n\n* No console errors\n* No React warnings\n* No hydration issues\n* No failed fetch requests\n* No missing assets\n* No broken routes\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5 - Security Audit\n\nVerify:\n\n* Prepared statements\n* XSS protection\n* CSRF protection\n* File upload validation\n* Session security\n* Authorization\n* Input validation\n* Output escaping\n\nFix every issue found.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 6 - Performance Audit\n\nMeasure:\n\n* Initial page load\n* Bundle size\n* API response times\n* Database query performance\n* Image loading\n* Font loading\n\nOptimize where safe.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 7 - cPanel Validation\n\nVerify the application works on shared cPanel hosting.\n\nCheck:\n\n* PHP configuration\n* MySQL connectivity\n* Upload permissions\n* File permissions\n* .htaccess\n* HTTPS\n* Error logs\n\n---\n\n## Phase 8 - Local Storage Audit\n\nSearch the project again.\n\nBusiness data must never be stored in:\n\n* localStorage\n* IndexedDB\n* sessionStorage\n\nOnly allow UI preferences such as:\n\n* Theme\n* Sidebar state\n* Language\n\nEverything else must come from MySQL.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 9 - Code Cleanup\n\nRemove:\n\n* Dead code\n* Unused imports\n* Unused components\n* Duplicate utilities\n* Unused assets\n* Legacy migration code\n* Commented-out code\n* Temporary debugging code\n\nDo not remove anything that is still in use.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 10 - Final Deliverables\n\nProvide:\n\n1. List of all bugs found.\n2. Files modified.\n3. Exact fixes applied.\n4. Remaining manual tasks (if any).\n5. Production readiness score.\n6. Confirmation that the application is fully ready for daily clinical use on cPanel with PHP + MySQL.",
